{"sourceUrl":"https://nursing.sysu.edu.cn/zh-hans/article/3316","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:39.817264+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://nursing.sysu.edu.cn/zh-hans/article/3316","html":"<div><p><span>我院现组织开展</span><span>2027</span><span>年接收优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试攻读研究生报名工作，请符合申请条件的申请人（包括本校应届生）按以下通知内容报名：</span><span></span></p><p><span><strong>一、申请条件</strong></span><span><strong></strong></span></p><p><span>（一）中华人民共和国公民；</span><span></span></p><p><span>（二）拥护中国共产党的领导，遵纪守法，品德良好；</span><span></span></p><p><span>（三）在目前就读学校取得</span><span>/</span><span>预计可取得教育部推荐免试研究生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生；</span><span></span></p><p><span>（四）学术研究兴趣浓厚，具有较强的创新意识、创新能力和作为博士、硕士研究生培养的潜质；</span><span></span></p><p><span>（五）诚实守信，学风端正，未受过任何处分；</span><span></span></p><p><span>（六）身心健康，符合国家和我校规定的体检要求；</span><span></span></p><p><span>（七）入学前须本科毕业并获得学士学位；</span><span></span></p><p><span>（八）其余申请条件要符合中山大学推荐免试研究生招生章程及接收办法中的要求。</span><span></span></p><p><span><strong>二、招生专业</strong></span><span><strong></strong></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span>专业名称</span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span>专业代码</span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span>学位类别</span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span>研究方向</span><span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>护理学</span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span>101100</span></p></td><td><p><span>学术学位</span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span>不分方向</span><span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>护理</span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span>105400</span></p></td><td><p><span>专业学位</span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span>不分方向</span><span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span>说明：2027</span><span>年研究生招生专业目录为准。各专业实际接收推免生人数将根据招生计划、生源情况等</span><br/><span>进行调整，以实际录取为准。</span><span></span></p><p><span><strong>三、报名申请</strong></span><span><strong></strong></span></p><p><span><strong>（一）申请材料</strong></span><span><strong></strong></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span><span>《中山大学护理学院</span><span>2027</span><span>年接收推荐免试生攻读研究生申请表》（附件</span><span>1</span><span>，打印并签名后扫描）</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span><span>身份证（须将正反面扫描）；</span><span>。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span><span>学生证（须将封面、个人信息页、注册信息页扫描）；</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>4.</span><span>获得免试资格证明或本科阶段同年级总评成绩排名证明（须教务部门或院系公章）；</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>5.</span><span>本科阶段学习成绩单（须教务部门或院系公章）；</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>6.</span><span>英语水平证明材料（如国家英语六级考试成绩、</span><span>TOEFL</span><span>、</span><span>GRE</span><span>、雅思等成绩复印件）；</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>7.</span><span>其他证明材料复印件（如以第一作者已发表过的学术论文或出版物、主持的科研项目立项批文等具有学术水平的工作成果证明，科技活动中获奖或有突出贡献的证明，获奖证书等）。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>面试资格审核时，须提供以上纸质材料复印件与原件（原件核对后归还）</strong></span><span><strong>。</strong></span></span><span>申请者须承诺所提供信息、材料及申请身份的真实性。一经查证为不属实或不符合我校招生要求的，我校将取消其申请资格、录取资格、入学资格，已入学的取消学籍。</span><span></span></p><p><span>申请者若存在有违学术道德、专业伦理、诚实守信等方面的不当行为，一经查实，立即取消其申请资格、录取资格、入学资格，已入学的取消学籍。</span><span></span></p><p><span><strong>（二）申请流程</strong></span><span><strong></strong></span></p><p><span><span><strong>1.</strong></span></span><span>请登录问卷星（</span><span>https://www.wjx.cn/vm/eUriRtA.aspx</span><span><span><strong>，或扫下二维码）</strong></span></span><span>线上填报相关信息，报名工作将于即日起至</span><span><span><strong>2026</strong></span><span><strong>年</strong></span><span><strong>9</strong></span><span><strong>月</strong></span><span><strong>7</strong></span><span><strong>日</strong></span><span><strong>23:00</strong></span><span><strong>截止</strong></span></span><span>。</span></p><img alt=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://nursing.sysu.edu.cn/sites/default/files/inline-images/%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%871_63.jpg\"/><p><span><span><strong>                                                         问卷链接与二维码</strong></span></span></p><ol start=\"2\"><li><p><span>发电子版材料到指定邮箱。</span><span><span>请于</span><span><strong>2026</strong></span><span><strong>年</strong></span><span><strong>9</strong></span><span><strong>月</strong></span><span><strong>7</strong></span><span><strong>日</strong></span><span><strong>23:00</strong></span><span><strong>前</strong></span></span><span>，将申请材料电子版或扫描件生成</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件放进文件夹（每份扫描件须命名、写上序号，例：</span><span>1</span><span>．申请表；</span><span>2</span><span>．身份证），然后以压缩包文件发送到邮箱</span><span><strong>zdhlyjs@mail.sysu.edu.cn</strong></span><span>。压缩文件夹命名“姓名</span><span>+</span><span>本科就读学校</span><span>+</span><span>推免预报名</span><span>+</span><span>联系电话”</span><span><span><strong>（每位申请者只发一个压缩文件夹）</strong></span></span><span>。不按照规定命名的文件视为无效文件处理。</span><span></span></p></li></ol><p><span><span><strong>注：步骤</strong></span><span><strong>1</strong></span><span><strong>和步骤</strong></span><span><strong>2</strong></span><span><strong>必须都完成，才视作报名成功</strong></span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3.<strong>2026</strong></span><span><strong>年</strong></span><span><strong>9</strong></span><span><strong>月</strong></span><span><strong>14</strong></span><span><strong>日前</strong></span></span><span><strong>，</strong>将于中山大学护理学院官（</span><span>https://nursing.sysu.edu.cn/</span><span>）上公布面试名单。</span><span><strong></strong></span></p><p><span><strong>四、</strong></span><a href=\"https://nursing.sysu.edu.cn/zh-hans/article/3316\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><strong>初审与复试</strong></span></a><span><strong></strong></span></p><p><span><strong>（一）初审</strong></span><span><strong></strong></span></p><p><span>学院将组织对申请材料初审后确定复试名单，并在学院官网上公布。考生应在指定的时间内确认是否参加，逾期视为放弃。</span><span></span></p><p><span><strong>（二）复试</strong></span><span><strong></strong></span></p><p><span>1. </span><span>复试形式：采取<strong>线下综合面试</strong>，每名考生面试时间不少于</span><span>20</span><span>分钟，全程录音录像。</span><span></span></p><p><span>2. </span><span>复试总分：</span><span>100</span><span>分，其中</span><span>30%</span><span>为英语考核，</span><span>70%</span><span>为业务能力及综合素质考核。</span><span></span></p><p><span>3. </span><span>考核时间：面试时间：</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>17-18</span><span>日；地点：广州市越秀区中山二路</span><span>74</span><span>号中山大学护理学院（具体场地另行通知，请报名者留意学院网站或邮件等通知）。考核内容见附件</span><span>2</span><span>《中山大学护理学院</span><span>2027</span><span>年接收推荐免试生攻读硕士学位研究综合评价考核办法》</span><span></span></p><p><span><strong>五、考核通过名单公布</strong></span><span><strong></strong></span></p><p><span>我院将根据复试情况，择优确定考核通过名单，拟录取名单在我院完成所有的推免生复试工作后统一于官网公布。</span><span></span></p><p><span>后续将通过教育部“推免服务系统”向拟接收的申请人发送待录取通知，收到待录取通知的申请者，须在规定时间内在“推免服务系统”上完成待录取确认，逾期未完成确认者视为放弃待录取资格。在“推免服务系统”上完成待录取确认的推免生不得变更录取志愿，不得撤销待录取。</span><span></span></p><p><span><strong>六、其他事项</strong></span><span><strong></strong></span></p><p><span><strong>1.</strong></span><span><strong>说明</strong></span><span><strong></strong></span></p><p><span>此通知为报名通知，具体要求以教育部及中山大学</span><span>2027</span><span>年推荐免试研究生接收办法及相关工作通知为准。</span><span></span></p><p><span>推免生的报名及录取均通过教育部“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（以下简称“推免服务系统”，网址</span><span>: https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/</span><span>）进行。</span><span></span></p><p><span>推免复审及体检要求请留意学校及院系后续发布的推免接收办法及相关通知。</span><span></span></p><p><span><strong>2.</strong></span><span><strong>联系方式</strong></span><span></span></p><p><span>联系人：黎老师；联系电话</span><span>02087334851</span></p><p><span>地址：广州市越秀区中山二路</span><span>74</span><span>号中山大学护理学院</span><span></span></p><p> </p><p><span>附件：</span><span>1.</span><span>《接收推荐免试生攻读研究生申请表》</span><span></span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>免试生攻读硕士学位研究生综合评价考核办法。</span><span></span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>中山大学研究生招生诚信复试承诺书</span><span></span></p><p> </p><p> </p><p><span>                                                        护理学院</span></p><p><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>14</span><span>日</span><br/><br/><span>初审：何笑霞</span></p><p><span>审核：满意</span></p><p><span>审定发布：陈昌龄</span><span></span><span></span></p><p><span></span></p></div>","textSha256":"a938a63a8a4fe787407c8eb834f94475b417427ce4e4f27740a764a11a034964","textLength":2029,"sourceSha256":"7636e1073f4319fee96bf65dffbd1a8002ea4986a3a74de3f9dbdc66bbc38f75","selector":".field-body","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-9e7e2f75196a11ddf641","title":"2026年中山大学护理学院2027年接收优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试攻读研究生报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:39.817264+00:00"}
